# ===== 插件运行时输出（含业务插件编译产物，可能携带连接信息/凭据，不提交） =====
**/Plugins/*.dll
**/Plugins/*.json
**/Plugins/*.so
**/Plugins/*.a
**/Plugins/runtimes/
**/Plugins/logs/
!**/Plugins/**/.gitkeep

# ===== 插件配置库（SQLite：含各插件连接参数/告警邮箱账号等敏感信息，不提交） =====
**/Plugins/*.db
**/Plugins/*.db-journal
**/Plugins/*.sqlite

# ===== 运行时日志 / 临时文件 =====
logs/
*.log
run_out.txt
run_err.txt
*.out.txt
*.err.txt
startup.log
build_*.txt

# ===== 数据库文件 / 配置 =====
*.db
*.sqlite
*.db-journal

# ===== 应用配置中的本地开发配置（可能含密钥，按需保留 appsettings.json） =====
appsettings.Development.json
appsettings.Production.json
